      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "${(3w+2v)}^{2}=$",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the following formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)^{2}={a}^{2}+2ab+{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=3w$ and $b=2v,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(3w+2v)}^{2} & = \\\\ {(3w)}^{2}+2(3w)(2v)+{(2v)}^{2} & = \\\\ 9{w}^{2}+12vw+4{v}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
