      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "${(4m-3{n}^{2})}^{2}=${{field-1}}${m}^{2}\\,\\,-$\n{{field-2}}$m{n}^{2}\\,\\,+$\n{{field-3}}${n}^{4}$",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the following formula:\n\n$$\n(a-b)^{2}={a}^{2}-2ab+{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=4m$ and $b=3{n}^{2},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(4m-3{n}^{2})}^{2} & = \\\\ {(4m)}^{2}-2(4m)(3{n}^{2})+{(3{n}^{2})}^{2} & = \\\\ 16{m}^{2}-24m{n}^{2}+9{n}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
